If such a block allowed only aggregations (not sure how you’d
limit the modeling language this way) then it would be straightforward
behind the scenes to pass the parameters to the aggregation function
before sending them off to be streamed to an interface.

That said, I think this would really entail an entirely new language
for specifying aggregations.  Not a simple task.

