Yes, I plan to leave "normal_log" as is.  The only thing that happens
if the user adds "_log" to one of their functions,

   real foo_log(T y, ...)

is that

   y ~ foo(...)

becomes synonymous with

  increment_log_prob(foo_log(y,...))

give or take some constant terms.

- Bob

