Subject: vectorizing lower/upper bounds for constrained variables
Message-ID: <c73kgSpQHrM.ICLbFCiOlPcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/c73kgSpQHrM/m/ICLbFCiOlPcJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
