Subject: Re: [stan-dev] use JSON as data input file format
Message-ID: <Ig3LDUXoZZU.iCbIo2KJmQMJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Ig3LDUXoZZU.tEZJEEVytTYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <Ig3LDUXoZZU.tEZJEEVytTYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
