For development I found it easier to play with the submodule by hand.  So instead of running

make stan-update/feature/foo-bar

I did

cd stan
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/stan-dev/stan.git
git checkout develop

Will this mess up the submodule juju?  In particular I couldn't push without updating origin from git:// to https://.

